{"file": "末日疯子：尸潮之下-第107集.mp4", "ep": 107, "duration": 50.1, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.24, "text": "然后让无人机翁翁想着过去"}, {"start": 2.24, "end": 3.4, "text": "告诉所有疯子"}, {"start": 3.4, "end": 3.9, "text": "嘿"}, {"start": 3.9, "end": 4.96, "text": "我们在这里"}, {"start": 4.96, "end": 6.14, "text": "快来看热闹"}, {"start": 6.14, "end": 7.04, "text": "林昊"}, {"start": 7.04, "end": 10.04, "text": "你是嫌我们死得不够快吗"}, {"start": 10.04, "end": 10.74, "text": "手机"}, {"start": 12.01, "end": 13.01, "text": "没网"}, {"start": 13.01, "end": 13.95, "text": "是破林子"}, {"start": 13.95, "end": 15.05, "text": "一颗信号都没有"}, {"start": 15.05, "end": 16.29, "text": "我的也是"}, {"start": 16.29, "end": 17.91, "text": "不过往外走"}, {"start": 17.91, "end": 18.81, "text": "或者高处"}, {"start": 18.81, "end": 19.49, "text": "应该会有信号"}, {"start": 19.49, "end": 25.73, "text": "好"}, {"start": 25.73, "end": 26.45, "text": "在哪"}, {"start": 26.45, "end": 28.45, "text": "也是你们放的吗"}, {"start": 28.45, "end": 30.07, "text": "怎么样"}, {"start": 30.07, "end": 31.17, "text": "发过去了"}, {"start": 31.17, "end": 33.22, "text": "还没回"}, {"start": 33.22, "end": 33.88, "text": "是"}, {"start": 33.88, "end": 34.88, "text": "别去"}, {"start": 34.88, "end": 44.41, "text": "我们先开位置共享慢慢会合"}, {"start": 44.61, "end": 45.61, "text": "我一个人往前走"}, {"start": 45.61, "end": 46.51, "text": "你们先躲在附近"}, {"start": 46.51, "end": 46.85, "text": "嗯"}, {"start": 46.85, "end": 47.75, "text": "进了"}, {"start": 47.75, "end": 48.75, "text": "万一"}, {"start": 48.75, "end": 50.05, "text": "万一不是他们的话"}]}